86
00:10:03,909 --> 00:10:08,949
With all due respect, sir, we made a mistake by letting the straw hat pirates keep that stolen treasure.

87
00:10:08,949 --> 00:10:10,389
Hm?

88
00:10:10,389 --> 00:10:16,289
I'm not certain if they found it yet, but if they do, could you please ask them to give the Tomate Box back to us?

89
00:10:16,449 --> 00:10:21,389
How dare you! I could never ask them to return a gift that we gave them for saving us!

90
00:10:21,829 --> 00:10:23,269
I know, but...

91
00:10:23,269 --> 00:10:31,089
If they open it, it'll explode! Why would you do such a thing?

92
00:10:32,089 --> 00:10:36,789
I'm sorry, but you see, after the Tomate Box was stolen ten years ago,

93
00:10:36,789 --> 00:10:40,649
I figured if another thief were to take it, we ought to teach them a lesson.

94
00:10:41,029 --> 00:10:45,349
I decided to rig the box with explosives that would detonate as soon as the box was opened.

95
00:10:45,549 --> 00:10:47,229
It seemed like a good idea at the time.

96
00:10:50,849 --> 00:10:56,049
But I was wrong, and since I'm in charge of the Tomate Box and the rest of the treasure chamber, I...

97
00:10:56,049 --> 00:10:57,669
Very well, I understand.

98
00:10:58,329 --> 00:11:01,069
If Luffy and the others return with the treasures,

99
00:11:01,069 --> 00:11:06,469
please explain the situation and take the Tomate Box back before someone gets hurt.

100
00:11:06,789 --> 00:11:08,069
I do apologize.

101
00:11:08,469 --> 00:11:09,329
Oh, dear.

102
00:11:09,749 --> 00:11:12,689
But there's still a chance that they'll open it before they get back.

103
00:11:12,969 --> 00:11:14,729
Yes, that concerns me as well.

104
00:11:15,249 --> 00:11:17,169
Your Majesty, Minister, an update.

105
00:11:17,509 --> 00:11:19,269
Luffy and the others have just returned.

106
00:11:19,509 --> 00:11:21,529
Ah, so they made it back safely.

107
00:11:22,129 --> 00:11:22,849
That's excellent.

108
00:11:23,389 --> 00:11:25,289
It appears I was worried over nothing.

109
00:11:28,289 --> 00:11:28,889
What?

110
00:11:28,889 --> 00:11:29,209
What?

111
00:11:29,789 --> 00:11:30,169
Huh?

112
00:11:31,369 --> 00:11:31,669
Huh?

113
00:11:32,409 --> 00:11:33,989
You gave the treasure?

114
00:11:34,269 --> 00:11:35,289
To Big Mom?

115
00:11:35,289 --> 00:11:36,709
Luffy!

116
00:11:37,709 --> 00:11:38,689
I had to.

117
00:11:38,769 --> 00:11:41,609
She was going to wreck the whole island because she didn't get any candy.

118
00:11:42,089 --> 00:11:43,209
What is her problem?

119
00:11:43,509 --> 00:11:45,209
I mean, if it was meat, I'd understand.

120
00:11:45,829 --> 00:11:46,509
Don't worry.

121
00:11:46,889 --> 00:11:48,049
I already handled it.

122
00:11:48,269 --> 00:11:51,189
Because I picked up that snail and gave her a piece of my mind.

123
00:11:51,449 --> 00:11:52,129
Seriously?

124
00:11:54,209 --> 00:11:56,369
Yeah, but no one talks back to her.

125
00:11:57,749 --> 00:11:59,489
My, that's wonderful.

126
00:11:59,489 --> 00:12:00,929
Well, you sure are brave, Luffy.

127
00:12:02,009 --> 00:12:03,189
Don't encourage him.

128
00:12:03,249 --> 00:12:04,449
This isn't a good thing.

129
00:12:05,169 --> 00:12:07,209
Please don't yell at me, Nusa.

130
00:12:07,989 --> 00:12:09,889
I told you it's Usa.

131
00:12:10,949 --> 00:12:11,429
Whatever.

132
00:12:11,789 --> 00:12:12,489
I'm sorry.

133
00:12:13,449 --> 00:12:14,109
Oh, Luffy.

134
00:12:14,289 --> 00:12:15,669
What have you done now?

135
00:12:15,669 --> 00:12:20,029
I'd better sever my bond with Big Mom before this gets any more complicated.

136
00:12:21,029 --> 00:12:25,929
I understand this may be difficult, especially for your hard-headed captain, but please refrain

137
00:12:25,929 --> 00:12:27,489
from agitating her anymore.

138
00:12:27,749 --> 00:12:28,589
No joke!

139
00:12:28,709 --> 00:12:31,669
She's one of the four emperors and I'm way too young to die!

140
00:12:31,749 --> 00:12:33,829
This is even worse than we feared.

141
00:12:34,129 --> 00:12:35,589
What are we going to do now?

142
00:12:35,589 --> 00:12:40,489
If Big Mom gets that tomate box and she opens it herself, it's going to blow up in her face

143
00:12:40,489 --> 00:12:41,309
and then we're screwed!

144
00:12:41,789 --> 00:12:45,249
She'll think Straw Hat's trying to start dribble and then there'll be a war on her hands.

145
00:12:45,269 --> 00:12:47,169
We mustn't let that happen!

146
00:12:49,289 --> 00:12:52,569
Well, it's not like you had any other choice, right?

147
00:12:52,989 --> 00:12:54,649
Yeah, it's already been done now.

148
00:12:55,189 --> 00:12:57,149
Guess you kind of had to stand up to her.

149
00:12:57,149 --> 00:12:59,749
I suppose I can't really be upset at you over that.

150
00:13:00,129 --> 00:13:00,529
Exactly!

151
00:13:00,749 --> 00:13:03,149
I couldn't just let her punish these guys for...

152
00:13:03,149 --> 00:13:14,309
That's my girl.

153
00:13:14,769 --> 00:13:15,349
Still!

154
00:13:15,729 --> 00:13:18,169
I can't believe you gave her all of this treasure!

155
00:13:18,649 --> 00:13:19,249
NUMMY!

156
00:13:20,709 --> 00:13:21,769
I'll put you out!

157
00:13:21,829 --> 00:13:23,109
You did that already!

158
00:13:24,029 --> 00:13:25,989
Okay, here it goes.

159
00:13:25,989 --> 00:13:27,269
To the new world!

160
00:13:27,629 --> 00:13:28,989
