162
00:13:31,989 --> 00:13:39,409
Meanwhile, not far from the candy factory...

163
00:13:39,409 --> 00:13:40,309
Damn it all!

164
00:13:40,869 --> 00:13:44,809
Someone must have picked up the treasures and ran when I was knocked out on the ground!

165
00:13:45,209 --> 00:13:49,689
Whoever the thief may be, I'll make sure they suffer for what they've done!

166
00:13:50,069 --> 00:13:54,029
All I have to do now is confront those pickpockets and take the riches back again.

167
00:13:54,029 --> 00:13:59,109
With that and the new information about the mermaid princess, I can make a good impression for sure!

168
00:13:59,429 --> 00:14:00,069
